        "original_id": "0b12a856-5f22-5e14-92d8-049f5835b2ba",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Bonfire, Back in Black, Live from the Atlantic Studios, Let's Get It Up, For Those About to Rock We Salute You, Let There Be Rock\n- People: Bon Scott, Robert John \"Mutt\" Lange\n- Organizations: AC/DC, Albert Productions, Atlantic Records\n\nFacts:\n- Back in Black was produced by Robert John \"Mutt\" Lange and released on 25 July 1980 by Albert Productions and Atlantic Records.\n- Let's Get It Up is a song by AC/DC that was first released on the 1981 album For Those About to Rock We Salute You and was later issued as that album's first single.\n- Bonfire is a five-disc box set by AC/DC that was released in 1997.\n- Bonfire was created as a tribute to AC/DC's earlier singer Bon Scott.\n- Bonfire included the two-disc soundtrack to the movie Let There Be Rock, some early unreleased tracks, Live from the Atlantic Studios, and a remastered version of Back in Black.\n- Live from the Atlantic Studios is a live album by AC/DC that was released on the Bonfire box set.\n- Bonfire was remastered and released in Digipak format in 2003.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "a8fdcfdf-0115-508a-b9c7-f398078a94b9",
        "text": "Page: Bonfire (album). Sentence: Bonfire is a five-disc box set by Australian band AC/DC, released in 1997, and remastered with a release in Digipak format in 2003.\nPage: Bonfire (album). Sentence: It was created as a tribute to the band's earlier singer Bon Scott and included the two disc soundtrack to the movie \"Let There Be Rock\", some early unreleased tracks, a live recording from the Atlantic Records studio in New York and a remastered version of \"Back in Black\".\nPage: Back in Black. Sentence: Produced by Robert John \"Mutt\" Lange, the album was released on 25 July 1980 by Albert Productions and Atlantic Records.\nPage: Live from the Atlantic Studios. Sentence: Live from the Atlantic Studios is a live album by AC/DC released on the \"Bonfire\" box set.\nPage: Let's Get It Up. Sentence: \"Let's Get It Up\" is a song by Australian hard rock band AC/DC, first released on their 1981 album \"For Those About to Rock We Salute You\", and later as its first single.",
